* {{RSL|Lava strykewyrm}}s are one of several kinds of {{RSL|strykewyrm}}s found in ''RuneScape 3''. In ''RuneScape 3'', they are a high-level Slayer monster that attacks with all three attack styles, unlike their ''Old School RuneScape'' counterparts that have a much lower Slayer level requirement and simpler mechanics, attacking only with [[melee]] and [[ranged]].

